	POLLUTE
Pollute is a small utility that stamps a file with a comment claiming your (or someone else's) ownership of that file, it also includes the date of creation, name of the file, and the name of the project.
It will reject any file that is larger than exactly 16MB, not because the code is shit, but because I said so

HOW TO USE POLLUTE
  Just type `pollute file project author year month date`
  Warning: pollute will write every parameter you give it exactly as is, that means if you input `shit` as the year, it will write that as the year

HOW TO COMPILE POLLUTE
  Type `make all` and that's it
